# DUNE EXPRESS: a lever flips every gate; the crank gun shoots whoever walks
# in front of it but turns on the lawmen when punched from behind; a punched
# ram charges and tramples whoever is in its way.
game dune
wait 5
cheat mission 7
expect tile165 == 5
expect tile325 == 6
cheat pos 11 6
cheat face 1
press B
expect tile165 == 6
expect tile325 == 5
cheat mission 6
cheat clear_law
cheat pos 10 6
wait 60
expect alive == 0
expect why == 7
cheat mission 6
cheat clear_law
cheat pos 13 6
cheat face 0
wait 2
press B
cheat pos 10 6
wait 60
expect alive == 1
cheat mission 12
hold DOWN
cheat pos 10 6
cheat face 1
wait 2
press B
wait 120
release DOWN
expect kills >= 1
expect alive == 1
